# A resident answering a player, more ways (Docs/Design/62-talk.md, phase 5 and 7): greetings, thanks, goodbyes, "what's
# wrong?" and "what day is it?" by the resident's traits, job, age, quarter and means, and the hour, weather and day.
# These take only their best tier (best_only), so each is written to join the tone's own lines at the same score,
# never to outrank them:
#   greet:  topic.meeting + one fact + priority 1 = 3, as a tone's greeting (the plain tone's own copy is here too)
#   thanks: one fact = 1, as a tone's thanks (and the plain tone's copy)
#   bye:    one fact = 1, as a tone's goodbye; to a known wolf, topic.meeting=known + one fact = 2, as the plain one
#   trouble, day: one fact = 1, wrapped around the game's own answer (#topic.answer#)
# Never #other.name#: a resident knows a player only by a name they were given (#topic.player#, doc 32).

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- The plain tone's own (so the rest mix in with it)

rule x7_pg_stranger_plain
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger tone=plain
priority 1
say #topic.greeting# | #greet#. Passing through? | Hello. Not from round here, are you? | #greet#, traveller. Fair road behind you? | Well met.

rule x7_pg_known_plain
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known tone=plain
priority 1
say #topic.player#! There you are. | #greet#, #topic.player#. Keeping well? | Ah, #topic.player#. What can I do for you? | Hello, #topic.player#. Still about, then?

rule x7_pt_plain
when concept=player.thanks tone=plain
say No trouble at all. | Happy to. | Any time. | Not at all. Glad it helped.

rule x7_pb_plain
when concept=player.bye tone=plain
say Take care, then. | Off you go. Mind how you go. | #farewell#. | Good luck to you.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Greeting a stranger

rule x7_pg_s_warm
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger warmth=warm
priority 1
say Hello, love! You look like you've come a long way. | Welcome! Have you eaten? You look like you haven't. | #greet#! Don't be shy, I don't bite.

rule x7_pg_s_cold
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger warmth=cold
priority 1
say Hm. | Yes? | I don't know you.

rule x7_pg_s_merry
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger humour=merry
priority 1
say Hello, stranger! Lost, or just lucky? | A new face! Wonderful. I was tired of all the old ones. | #greet#! Don't mind the smell, it's the town.

rule x7_pg_s_dry
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger humour=dry
priority 1
say A traveller. How exciting for us both. | Hello. You've found us, then. Commiserations. | Ah. Someone new to disappoint.

rule x7_pg_s_nervy
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger temper=nervy
priority 1
say Oh! Hello. You gave me a start. | Who... oh. Hello. | Hello? Can I... is something wrong?

rule x7_pg_s_short
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger temper=short
priority 1
say What? | Make it quick. | Yes, yes, hello. What?

rule x7_pg_s_chatty
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger self.talk=chatty
priority 1
say Hello! New in town? Where from? Staying long? Sorry, I do go on. | Oh, hello! I've not seen you before, and I see everyone.

rule x7_pg_s_quiet
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger self.talk=quiet
priority 1
say Hello. | Mm. Hello. | #greet#.

rule x7_pg_s_devout
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger piety=devout
priority 1
say Bright One keep you, traveller. | Peace on your road. | #greet#, and blessings.

rule x7_pg_s_sly
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger honesty=sly
priority 1
say Well now. And what might you be looking for? | Hello, friend. New in town? I know everyone worth knowing. | A stranger with a purse. Welcome.

rule x7_pg_s_old
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger stage=old
priority 1
say Eh? Speak up, pup. | Hello, young one. Don't see many new faces now. | #greet#. Mind, I won't remember you tomorrow.

rule x7_pg_s_young
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger stage=young
priority 2
say Hello! Are you a bandit? You look like a bandit! | Who are you? #mum# says not to talk to strangers. Hello! | Hello! Want to see my stick?

rule x7_pg_s_adolescent
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger stage=adolescent
priority 1
say What? | Oh. 'Lo. | You're not from here, are you? Lucky.

rule x7_pg_s_guard
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger role=guard
priority 1
say Traveller. Keep the peace and we'll get on. | #greet#. Your business here? | Hello. No trouble, now.

rule x7_pg_s_merchant
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger role=merchant
priority 1
say #greet#! Buying? | Hello, hello! First time here? Have a look at what I've got. | Welcome, welcome! Coin's welcome too.

rule x7_pg_s_priest
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger job=priest
priority 1
say Welcome, child of the road. | The Bright One's peace on you. | Hello, traveller. You're welcome at the chapel any day.

rule x7_pg_s_beggar
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger job=beggar
priority 1
say Spare a penny, kind traveller? | Hello, friend. You've a generous face. | Spare something for the hungry? Thank you kindly.

rule x7_pg_s_innkeeper
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger job=innkeeper
priority 1
say Welcome! Looking for a bed? | Hello, traveller! Ale, food, or both? | Come in, come in. You look thirsty.

rule x7_pg_s_sailor
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger job=sailor|fisher
priority 1
say Tide's with you, stranger. | Hello, landlubber. | Fair winds, stranger.

rule x7_pg_s_rich
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger wealth=rich
priority 1
say Yes? Good day. | Ah. A traveller. How quaint. | Good day. Do I know you? No.

rule x7_pg_s_poor
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger wealth=poor|destitute
priority 1
say Hello. You've not got a spare crust, have you? No. Hello. | Don't mind me. I'm nobody. | #greet#. You look better fed than me.

rule x7_pg_s_sump
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger quarter=sump
priority 1
say Lost, are you? You look lost. | Hello. Keep your purse close round here. | New to Ridgemere? Keep out of the Sump after dark.

rule x7_pg_s_heights
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger quarter=heights
priority 1
say Good day. Are you expected? | Hello. Visiting someone on the Heights? | Good day. Tradesmen use the side door, as a rule.

rule x7_pg_s_dawn
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.time=dawn
priority 1
say Morning! You're up early. | Good morning. On the road at this hour? | Morning. Barely.

rule x7_pg_s_night
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.time=night
priority 1
say Late to be wandering, stranger. | Evening. Got somewhere to sleep? | #greet#. Mind the dark.

rule x7_pg_s_rain
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.weather=rain|storm
priority 1
say Hello! Come out of the wet. | Lovely weather for travelling, eh? | Hello. You're soaked through.

rule x7_pg_s_snow
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.weather=snow
priority 1
say Hello! Get by a fire, you're half frozen. | Snow on your ears, traveller. | #greet#. Cold one, isn't it?

rule x7_pg_s_market
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.day=market
priority 1
say Hello! Here for the market? | Market day! Mind your purse. | #greet#. Busy one today.

rule x7_pg_s_festival
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.day=festival
priority 1
say Happy festival! Come and join in! | #greet#! You picked a good day to arrive. | Hello! Have a cake. Everyone's having cake.

rule x7_pg_s_rest
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger here.day=rest
priority 1
say Blessed Restday. | Hello. Quiet today. Everyone's resting. | #greet#. Shops are shut, mostly.

rule x7_pg_s_working
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger working=yes
priority 1
say Hello. I'm working, but go on. | #greet#. Can't stop long. | Hello. Mind, I'm busy.

rule x7_pg_s_tired
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=stranger tired=yes
priority 1
say Mm. Hello. Long day. | Hello. Forgive me, I'm dead on my feet. | #greet#. Is it bedtime yet?

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Greeting a wolf they know

rule x7_pg_k_warm
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known warmth=warm
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Come here! | Oh, #topic.player#, you've made my day. | #topic.player#, love! How are you keeping?

rule x7_pg_k_cold
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known warmth=cold
priority 1
say #topic.player#. | Oh. #topic.player#. | Hm. You.

rule x7_pg_k_merry
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known humour=merry
priority 1
say #topic.player#! What trouble have you brought me today? | Look who it is! Hide the cakes! | #topic.player#! I was just talking about you. All lies, don't worry.

rule x7_pg_k_dry
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known humour=dry
priority 1
say #topic.player#. Again. What a treat. | Ah, #topic.player#. My day was too peaceful anyway. | You keep coming back, #topic.player#. People will talk.

rule x7_pg_k_chatty
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known self.talk=chatty
priority 1
say #topic.player#! You'll never guess what's happened since you were here! | Oh, #topic.player#, I've so much to tell you!

rule x7_pg_k_quiet
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known self.talk=quiet
priority 1
say #topic.player#. | Hello, #topic.player#. | Mm. #topic.player#.

rule x7_pg_k_nervy
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known temper=nervy
priority 1
say Oh! #topic.player#. I didn't hear you come up. | #topic.player#! Is everything all right? | Oh, it's you. Thank the gods.

rule x7_pg_k_devout
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known piety=devout
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Bright One keep you. | Blessings, #topic.player#. | Good to see you safe, #topic.player#.

rule x7_pg_k_old
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known stage=old
priority 1
say Ah, #topic.player#. Come and sit with an old wolf. | #topic.player#! I remembered your name. See? | #topic.player#. You look tired. Young ones always look tired.

rule x7_pg_k_young
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known stage=young
priority 2
say #topic.player#! #topic.player#! Look what I found! | It's #topic.player#! Hello! | #topic.player#, can you lift me up?

rule x7_pg_k_guard
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known role=guard
priority 1
say #topic.player#. Behaving yourself? | #topic.player#. Quiet shift so far. Keep it that way. | #greet#, #topic.player#. Anything to report?

rule x7_pg_k_merchant
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known role=merchant
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Buying today? | My favourite customer! Well, one of them. #topic.player#! | #topic.player#. I've got just the thing for you.

rule x7_pg_k_dawn
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known here.time=dawn
priority 1
say Morning, #topic.player#! Early again? | #topic.player#, you're up with the larks. | Morning, #topic.player#. Don't talk to me till I've woken up.

rule x7_pg_k_night
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known here.time=night
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Out late again? | Evening, #topic.player#. Mind the dark. | #topic.player#. Can't sleep either?

rule x7_pg_k_rain
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known here.weather=rain|storm
priority 1
say #topic.player#! You're drenched! | Come out of the rain, #topic.player#. | #topic.player#, you're wet to the skin!

rule x7_pg_k_festival
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known here.day=festival
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Happy festival! | #topic.player#! Have you had a cake yet? | #topic.player#! Isn't it a grand day?

rule x7_pg_k_market
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known here.day=market
priority 1
say #topic.player#! Here for the market? | Market day, #topic.player#. Got your purse? | #topic.player#! Good timing, the stalls are full.

rule x7_pg_k_poor
when concept=player.greet topic.meeting=known wealth=poor|destitute
priority 1
say #topic.player#. Good to see a friendly face. | Hello, #topic.player#. Hard times. Don't mind me. | #topic.player#. Got a moment for a poor wolf?

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thanks

rule x7_pt_warm
when concept=player.thanks warmth=warm
say Oh, it was nothing, love. | Anything for you. | Go on with you. My pleasure.

rule x7_pt_cold
when concept=player.thanks warmth=cold
say Hm. | Yes. | Fine.

rule x7_pt_merry
when concept=player.thanks humour=merry
say I'll add it to your slate! | Thank me with cake. | Ha! Don't mention it. Well, mention it to everyone.

rule x7_pt_dry
when concept=player.thanks humour=dry
say I'll treasure that. | High praise. I'll have it carved over the door. | Yes, I'm wonderful. We all know.

rule x7_pt_devout
when concept=player.thanks piety=devout
say Thank the Bright One, not me. | The gods' work, not mine. | Bless you for saying so.

rule x7_pt_sly
when concept=player.thanks honesty=sly
say Remember it, that's all. | Thanks are free. Favours aren't. | One day I'll ask you for something.

rule x7_pt_frank
when concept=player.thanks honesty=frank
say It was nothing. Honestly. | You'd have managed. | Don't thank me, I'd have done it for anyone.

rule x7_pt_quiet
when concept=player.thanks self.talk=quiet
say Mm. | Welcome. | Aye.

rule x7_pt_chatty
when concept=player.thanks self.talk=chatty
say Oh, think nothing of it! I'd do it for anyone, well, almost anyone, my cousin, no. | You're welcome! Come back and tell me how it goes!

rule x7_pt_short
when concept=player.thanks temper=short
say Yes, yes. | Fine. Off you go. | Don't make a fuss.

rule x7_pt_nervy
when concept=player.thanks temper=nervy
say Oh! Was it all right? Good. Good. | You're welcome. I hope it helps. | Oh, it was nothing. Was it?

rule x7_pt_old
when concept=player.thanks stage=old
say Manners! Nice to see, these days. | You're a good pup. | My pleasure. Come back and visit an old wolf.

rule x7_pt_young
when concept=player.thanks stage=young
priority 1
say You're welcome! | I helped! I helped! | Can I have a penny?

rule x7_pt_merchant
when concept=player.thanks role=merchant
say Thank you! Come again! | Pleasure doing business. | Tell your friends!

rule x7_pt_guard
when concept=player.thanks role=guard
say Just doing my job. | That's what the Watch is for. | Keep out of trouble, and that's thanks enough.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Goodbye

rule x7_pb_warm
when concept=player.bye warmth=warm
say Look after yourself, love. | Come back soon, won't you? | Safe roads! And eat something!

rule x7_pb_cold
when concept=player.bye warmth=cold
say Mm. | Goodbye. | Right.

rule x7_pb_merry
when concept=player.bye humour=merry
say Off you go! Don't do anything I wouldn't. | Bye! Don't let the door hit your tail. | Go on! Come back with a story.

rule x7_pb_dry
when concept=player.bye humour=dry
say I'll try to bear it. | Leaving so soon? Good. Ha. | Do come back. Or don't. I'll cope.

rule x7_pb_devout
when concept=player.bye piety=devout
say #bless.capitalize#. | Go in peace. | May the Bright One light your road.

rule x7_pb_nervy
when concept=player.bye temper=nervy
say Be careful out there! | Mind the roads. They say there's bandits. | Oh. Bye. Take care. Really take care.

rule x7_pb_chatty
when concept=player.bye self.talk=chatty
say Oh, already? I had more to tell you! Next time, then. | Bye! Come back and I'll tell you about my sister.

rule x7_pb_old
when concept=player.bye stage=old
say Go on, then. Don't keep the road waiting. | Come back while I'm still here. | Safe roads, pup.

rule x7_pb_young
when concept=player.bye stage=young
priority 1
say Bye! Bye! | Come back tomorrow! | Can I come too?

rule x7_pb_guard
when concept=player.bye role=guard
say Keep the peace. | Off you go. Stay out of trouble. | Mind yourself on the road.

rule x7_pb_merchant
when concept=player.bye role=merchant
say Next time, buy something! Ha! | Come back soon! | Off you go. Tell your friends about me.

rule x7_pb_night
when concept=player.bye here.time=night|dusk
say Mind the dark. | Get yourself indoors. | Sleep well, wherever you sleep.

rule x7_pb_rain
when concept=player.bye here.weather=rain|storm
say Keep dry, if you can. | Mind the puddles. | Go on, run for it.

rule x7_pb_snow
when concept=player.bye here.weather=snow
say Keep your paws warm. | Mind the ice. | Wrap up. It's bitter out.

rule x7_pb_bandits
when concept=player.bye world.bandits=near
say Mind the roads. Bandits about. | Go in company, if you're travelling. | Keep off the road after dark. They've hit a caravan.

rule x7_pbk_warm
when concept=player.bye topic.meeting=known warmth=warm
say Look after yourself, #topic.player#! | Come back soon, #topic.player#. | Safe roads, #topic.player#, love.

rule x7_pbk_merry
when concept=player.bye topic.meeting=known humour=merry
say Off you go, #topic.player#! Bring me back a story. | Bye, #topic.player#! Behave! Or don't, and tell me about it.

rule x7_pbk_devout
when concept=player.bye topic.meeting=known piety=devout
say Bright One keep you, #topic.player#. | Go in peace, #topic.player#. | Blessings on your road, #topic.player#.

rule x7_pbk_old
when concept=player.bye topic.meeting=known stage=old
say Come back soon, #topic.player#. I'm not getting younger. | Off you go, #topic.player#. Mind yourself.

rule x7_pbk_night
when concept=player.bye topic.meeting=known here.time=night|dusk
say Sleep well, #topic.player#. | Mind the dark, #topic.player#. | Night, #topic.player#.

rule x7_pbk_dry
when concept=player.bye topic.meeting=known humour=dry
say Until next time, #topic.player#. I'll count the hours. | Goodbye, #topic.player#. Try not to get famous.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- What's wrong? (the game's answer, wrapped)

rule x7_ptr_warm
when concept=player.trouble warmth=warm
say That's kind of you to ask. #topic.answer# | Oh, love. #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_cold
when concept=player.trouble warmth=cold
say Why do you ask? #topic.answer# | Hm. #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_quiet
when concept=player.trouble self.talk=quiet
say Mm. #topic.answer# | ... #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_chatty
when concept=player.trouble self.talk=chatty
say Oh, where do I start? #topic.answer# | You want to know? Really? Well. #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_short
when concept=player.trouble temper=short
say #topic.answer# There. Happy? | Since you're asking. #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_nervy
when concept=player.trouble temper=nervy
say Oh. Is it that obvious? #topic.answer# | Does it show? #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_dry
when concept=player.trouble humour=dry
say Where to begin. #topic.answer# | Apart from everything? #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_devout
when concept=player.trouble piety=devout
say The Bright One knows. And now you. #topic.answer# | I've prayed on it. #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_old
when concept=player.trouble stage=old
say Ah, pup. #topic.answer# | When you're my age, something always is. #topic.answer#

rule x7_ptr_guarded
when concept=player.trouble honesty=guarded
say Hm. #topic.answer# | I don't say this to many. #topic.answer#

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- What day is it? (the game's answer, and a word on it)

rule x7_pd_market
when concept=player.day here.day=market
say #opener# #topic.answer# Early's best, mind. | #opener# #topic.answer# Watch your purse, the cutpurses love a market.

rule x7_pd_rest
when concept=player.day here.day=rest
say #opener# #topic.answer# Chapel at noon, if you're minded. | #opener# #topic.answer# Shops shut by noon, mind.

rule x7_pd_festival
when concept=player.day here.day=festival
say #opener# #topic.answer# Have you not heard the music? | #topic.answer# Go on, enjoy yourself!

rule x7_pd_work
when concept=player.day here.day=work
say #opener# #topic.answer# Just another working day. | #opener# #topic.answer# Same as yesterday, near enough.

rule x7_pd_old
when concept=player.day stage=old
say Let me think. #topic.answer# | Ask me the year next, go on. #topic.answer#

rule x7_pd_young
when concept=player.day stage=young
priority 1
say I know this one! #topic.answer# | #topic.answer# #mum# told me!

rule x7_pd_dry
when concept=player.day humour=dry
say Lost track, have you? #topic.answer# | #topic.answer# All day, I'm told.

rule x7_pd_devout_rest
when concept=player.day here.day=rest piety=devout
say #topic.answer# The Bright One's day. You'll come to chapel? | #topic.answer# A day for giving thanks.

rule x7_pd_festival_soon
when concept=player.day world.festival=soon
say #opener# #topic.answer# And the festival's soon! | #opener# #topic.answer# Not long till the festival, mind.
